The native state-volume implementation in this directory is original routerd2
code, distributed under the repository's BSD-3-Clause license.

It uses Linux syscall interfaces through golang.org/x/sys/unix and reads the
documented Linux mountinfo, fdinfo, and ext4 superblock formats. No util-linux,
e2fsprogs, systemd, or Linux kernel implementation code is copied or linked into
this package. Linux filesystem and block drivers remain kernel components under
their respective licenses. The separate QEMU test fixture may use a host
e2fsprogs formatter only on a newly created private regular-file test image.
